格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"API Key rotation pool for DeepSeek Harness: multi-key round-robin, failover on 401/403/429, cooldown & recovery, Web UI management panel","id":"gh:1334912530","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-api-key-pool","slug":"xiaozhe7772222/dsh-api-key-pool","topics":["api-key","api-key-rotation","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"API Key rotation pool for DeepSeek Harness: multi-key round-robin, failover on 401/403/429, cooldown"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" & recovery, Web UI management panel"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-api-key-pool"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**API Key 轮换池插件 · API Key Rotation Pool Plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> 🐧 **Designed & built by 小哲** (@xiaozhe7772222)"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"多 Key 自动轮换 · 失败自动切换 · 冷却恢复 · Web 管理面板"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Multi-key round-robin · Automatic failover · Cooldown & recovery · Web UI panel"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**English** | 中文"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## English"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### ✨ Features"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Feature | Description |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| 🔄 **Round-robin rotation** | Multiple keys per provider, rotated per request for load balancing |\n"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"| 🛡️ **Automatic failover** | Key fails with `401 / 403 / 429` → automatically marked unhealthy, nex"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"t key takes over |\n| ⏱️ **Cooldown & recovery** | Failed keys enter exponential-backoff cooldown (30"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"s default), auto back in rotation when expired |\n| 🌐 **Web management panel** | DSH Web UI → Setting"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"s → Plugins → **API Key Pool**: add/remove keys, view health, reset cooldowns |\n| 🔒 **Key masking** "},{"id":"p11s6","text":"| REST API only exposes masked keys (`sk-abc****1234`), never full secrets |\n| 💾 **Persistent config"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"** | Keys added via Web UI persist to `pool-config.json`, survive restarts |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 📦 Installation"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Then declare the bundle in `~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json`:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Restart DSH:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### ⚙️ Configuration"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"#### Option 1: Static config via `cordis.patch.yml`"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Field | Type | Description |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| `pools.<provider>.apiKeyEnv` | string | Env var name for this provider's API key (must match `apiK"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"eyEnv` in `settings.yaml`) |\n| `pools.<provider>.keys` | string[] | List of API keys to rotate |\n| `"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"pools.<provider>.cooldownMs` | number | Cooldown per key after failure (ms) |\n| `defaultCooldownMs` "},{"id":"p22s4","text":"| number | Global default cooldown (ms), default `30000` |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"#### Option 2: Web management panel (runtime)"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"After starting DSH, open **Settings → Plugins → API Key Pool**:\n- View each provider's key health (g"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"reen = healthy, orange = cooling)\n- Paste a new key and click **Add**\n- Click `✕` to remove a key\n- "},{"id":"p24s3","text":"Click **Reset cooldown** to clear cooling state for a provider\n- Click **Refresh** to reload status"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Keys added via the panel persist to `pool-config.json` automatically."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### 🧠 How it works (v0.3.0)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**Key design**: DSH resolves credentials in the order `process.env > .credentials.yaml > .env`. This"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" plugin leverages that — it temporarily rewrites `process.env` in the `agent/request` waterfall for "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"**hot key switching with zero config file changes**. Since v0.3.0, a failed key not only enters cool"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"down but also asks the agent loop to **retry with the next key immediately** (previously it only mar"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"ked the key and the request died)."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### 🔌 REST API"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The plugin registers routes on the DSH web server."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"#### `GET /dsh-api-key-pool/pools`"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Returns all pools with masked keys, health states, and env names:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"#### `POST /dsh-api-key-pool/pools`"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| action | body | Description |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| `add` | `{ action, provider, key }` | Add a key |\n| `remove` | `{ action, provider, key }` | Remov"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"e a key |\n| `update` | `{ action, provider, keys: [] }` | Replace the full key list |\n| `reset` | `{"},{"id":"p36s3","text":" action, provider }` | Reset all cooldown states for a provider |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Example:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"### 🗂️ Project structure"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"### 🏷️ Topics"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"`deepseek-harness` · `dsh` · `api-key` · `api-key-rotation` · `key-pool` · `failover` · `load-balanc"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"ing` · `round-robin` · `circuit-breaker` · `llm` · `openai` · `plugin` · `cordis`"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"### 📄 License"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"MIT License — free to use, modify, distribute. **Never commit your real API keys to a public repo.**"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## 中文文档"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"> 🚀 **解决在 DeepSeek Harness 框架上面使用中转站模型或者第三方模型限流问题**"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"### ✨ 功能特性"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"| 功能 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"| 🔄 **自动轮换** | 同一供应商配置多个 Key，请求时依次轮换，均衡负载 |\n| 🛡️ **失败切换** | Key 返回 `401 / 403 / 429` 时自动标记故障，切换到下一个健"},{"id":"p49s2","text":"康 Key |\n| ⏱️ **冷却恢复** | 故障 Key 按指数退避进入冷却期（默认 30s 起步），到期自动回到轮换池 |\n| 🌐 **Web 管理面板** | DSH Web UI → 设置 "},{"id":"p49s3","text":"→ 插件配置 → **API Key 池**：直接增删 Key、查看健康状态、重置冷却 |\n| 🔒 **Key 脱敏** | REST 接口对外只返回脱敏后的 Key（`sk-abc****1234`"},{"id":"p49s4","text":"），不泄露完整密钥 |\n| 💾 **配置持久化** | Web 面板添加的 Key 持久化到 `pool-config.json`，重启后依然有效 |"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"### 📦 安装"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"然后在 `~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json` 的 `dsh.profile.bundles` 中声明："},{"id":"p53s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"重启 DSH："},{"id":"p55s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p56s1","text":"### ⚙️ 配置说明"},{"id":"p57s1","text":"#### 方式一：cordis.patch.yml（静态配置）"},{"id":"p58s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p59s1","text":"| 字段 | 类型 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p60s1","text":"| `pools.<provider>.apiKeyEnv` | string | 该供应商的 API Key 对应的环境变量名（需与 `settings.yaml` 中 `apiKeyEnv` 一致"},{"id":"p60s2","text":"） |\n| `pools.<provider>.keys` | string[] | 要轮换的多个 API Key |\n| `pools.<provider>.cooldownMs` | number"},{"id":"p60s3","text":" | 单个 Key 失败后的冷却时长（毫秒） |\n| `defaultCooldownMs` | number | 全局默认冷却时长（毫秒），默认 `30000` |"},{"id":"p61s1","text":"#### 方式二：Web 管理面板（运行时）"},{"id":"p62s1","text":"启动 DSH 后，打开 **设置 → 插件配置 → API Key 池**：\n- 查看各供应商 Key 健康状态（绿点 = 健康，橙点 = 冷却中）\n- 输入框粘贴新 Key，点击「添加」\n- 点击 "},{"id":"p62s2","text":"`✕` 移除不想用的 Key\n- 点击「重置冷却」清空某个供应商的冷却状态\n- 点击「刷新」重新加载状态"},{"id":"p63s1","text":"Web 面板添加的 Key 会自动持久化到 `pool-config.json`，重启后依然有效。"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
